  "recipe_steps": [
    "Rinse the lentils and cook in unsalted water according to their pack directions until tender, then drain. Record their actual cooked, drained mass if using the nutrition demonstration. The fixture assumes 1000 g; this is an illustrative measurement, not a validated dry-to-cooked yield.",
    "Cook 350 g dry rice in water according to the pack directions.",
    "Peel and chop 300 g onions, 400 g carrots and 20 g garlic. Wash the broccoli and spinach.",
    "Use 20 ml of the measured oil to soften the onions and carrots in a large pan. Add garlic, 6 g cumin, 6 g paprika and 2 g black pepper; stir briefly.",
    "Add both 400 g cans of tomatoes and enough water for a stew. Simmer until the carrots are tender. Stir in the cooked lentils and 250 g spinach and heat through.",
    "Steam the 500 g broccoli until cooked as preferred. Dress with the remaining 10 ml oil and juice from one lemon.",
    "Divide the rice, lentil stew and broccoli into five portions. The five portions define the teaching calculation; appetites and nutrition needs vary."
  ],
